==Special attack==
[[File:Sol Slam.webp|thumb|350px|A player performing the sunlight spear's special attack, ''Sol Slam''.]]
The sunlight spear has a [[special attack]], ''Sol Slam'', which consumes 7 Sunlight Stacks (rather than special attack energy). The special attack will hit all targets within three tiles of the player, with the damage dealt increasing by 3% per [[prayer bonus]] the player has. This does not require the player to be in combat, and deals typeless damage, so it can be used to damage enemies that are normally immune to melee, such as [[Nylocas Hagios]].

Equipping the sunlight spear replaces the special attack interface with a unique graphic ([[File:Sunlight Stack.png|link=]]) that indicates the Sunlight Stack resource, however player's special attack energy continues to regenerate in the background normally.

Additionally, the special attack is not a basic attack, meaning that the player can perform a regular attack followed by Sol Slam on the next game tick, though the animation of the special attack will prevent the player from attacking normally, so it is best used right after a regular attack.

{{Bug|When the minimap has been minimised the normal special attack graphic is used instead}}

